## Future Improvements

- Add a confusion matrix and per-class precision, recall, and F1-score.
- Save the best model checkpoint for reuse.
- Test transfer learning with a pretrained image model.
- Improve data augmentation and tune hyperparameters.
- Add a simple interface for uploading an image and viewing the predicted age group.

## Limitations

- Predictions depend on the quality, balance, and labeling of the dataset.
- Performance may vary across different lighting conditions, poses, and image qualities.
- This is an age-group classification experiment, not a reliable way to determine a person's exact age.
- Predictions should not be used as the sole basis for consequential decisions.
